# Cloudflare Pages headers for the blog origin.
# The blog is published publicly at https://nvnest.com/blog via a Worker proxy;
# this keeps the raw *.pages.dev origin out of search results (avoids duplicate
# content). Canonical/OG/sitemap URLs already point at nvnest.com/blog.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
